Upstream-Name: jitsi-audio-bridge
Source: https://github.com/amarulasolutions/jitsi-audio-bridge
Comment: This package carries its own Python dependencies in a virtualenv
 under /usr/lib/jitsi-audio-bridge.  Each of them is unmodified and keeps its
 own LICENSE and NOTICE files inside its .dist-info directory; they are listed
 here so that a single file accounts for everything the package contains.

